# PRD §6.2 — the human review gate on the skill registry.
#
# The automated similarity check catches near-duplicate skills; this catches the rest.
# A new skill is a new capability exposed to a model, and the failure mode it guards
# against is not a bug, it is four hundred near-identical skills in eighteen months with
# nobody able to say which one an agent should call.
/packages/cortex/manifests/skills/   @Amiteshd-nd

# Prompts are product surface with a release process (§7). Same reasoning.
/packages/cortex/prompts/            @Amiteshd-nd

# The eight adapter interfaces are the portability contract. Changing one is a breaking
# change for every host that has implemented it.
/packages/cortex/src/core/adapters/  @Amiteshd-nd
